## 4. Module Design

### 4.1 Frontend Architecture

The client is organized into a modular component hierarchy:

```
client/src/
├── App.jsx                          # Root component + sync orchestration
├── main.jsx                         # React entry point
├── index.css                        # Design system (CSS variables)
├── components/
│   ├── Canvas/PhysicsCanvas.jsx     # Matter.js renderer + interaction
│   ├── Layout/TopBar.jsx            # Play/Pause, Reset, Step controls
│   ├── Toolbar/ToolPalette.jsx      # Body + constraint creation tools
│   ├── Inspector/PropertyPanel.jsx  # Selected body property editor
│   ├── Dashboard/BottomPanel.jsx    # Analytics charts + collision log
│   ├── Experiments/ExperimentGallery.jsx  # Template library modal
│   ├── Room/RoomLobby.jsx           # Room create/join UI
│   ├── Room/CursorOverlay.jsx       # Multi-user cursor rendering
│   └── ErrorBoundary.jsx            # Crash-safe wrappers
├── contexts/
│   └── EngineContext.jsx            # Matter.js engine ref provider
├── hooks/
│   ├── useSocket.js                 # Socket.io connection + events
│   ├── useAnalytics.js              # Real-time physics data sampling
│   ├── useKeyboardShortcuts.js      # Ctrl+Z, Delete, Space, etc.
│   └── useUndoRedo.js               # Undo/redo state snapshots
├── stores/
│   ├── canvasStore.js               # Tool, selection, simulation state
│   ├── roomStore.js                 # Multi-user room state
│   └── uiStore.js                   # Modal + panel visibility
├── utils/
│   ├── physicsSerializer.js         # World serialize/deserialize
│   └── materials.js                 # Physics material presets
└── data/
    └── templates.js                 # 8 experiment configurations
```

### 4.2 Backend Architecture

```
server/src/
├── app.js                           # Express + Socket.io server entry
├── config/
│   └── db.js                        # MongoDB connection handler
├── middleware/
│   ├── authMiddleware.js            # JWT verification (required + optional)
│   └── errorHandler.js              # Global error response formatter
├── models/
│   ├── User.js                      # User schema (username, password, avatar)
│   ├── Room.js                      # Room schema (code, host, members)
