## 6. Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[User Interaction] --> B{Tool Selected?}
    B -->|Select| C[Click Body → Inspector Panel]
    B -->|Shape| D[Click Canvas → Create Body]
    B -->|Constraint| E[Click Body A → Click Body B → Create Constraint]
    B -->|Eraser| F[Click Body → Remove]
    
    D --> G[Register in Canvas Store]
    E --> G
    F --> G
    
    G --> H{In Room?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Serialize World → Socket Broadcast]
    H -->|No| J[Local Only]
    
    K[Play Button] --> L[Matter.Engine.update Loop]
    L --> M[useAnalytics Samples]
    M --> N[Recharts Live Graphs]
    L --> O{Is Host + In Room?}
    O -->|Yes| I
```

