## 8. Security Considerations

| Mechanism | Implementation |
|-----------|---------------|
| **Password Hashing** | bcryptjs with automatic salt rounds |
| **JWT Authentication** | HS256 signed tokens with configurable expiry |
| **Helmet.js** | HTTP security headers (XSS, MIME sniffing, etc.) |
| **CORS** | Strict origin whitelisting for API and WebSocket |
| **Input Validation** | express-validator on all route inputs |
| **Rate Limiting** | Configurable via environment variables |
| **Environment Secrets** | `.env` files excluded from version control |

---

## 9. Deployment Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Docker Compose
        A[Nginx Container<br/>Serves React Build] -->|Proxy /api, /socket.io| B[Node.js Container<br/>Express + Socket.io]
        B --> C[(MongoDB Container)]
    end
    
    D[Browser Client] -->|HTTPS| A
```

**Docker configuration:**
- **Client:** Multi-stage build — `npm run build` → Nginx serving static files
- **Server:** Node.js container running Express + Socket.io
- **Database:** Official MongoDB image with persistent volume mount

