## 10. Testing & Verification

### 10.1 Experiment Verification

All 8 experiments were tested using automated browser agents:

| Experiment | Bodies | Constraints | Physics Status |
|-----------|--------|-------------|---------------|
| Simple Pendulum | 1 bob | 1 rope | ✅ Oscillates correctly |
| Newton's Cradle | 5 balls | 5 ropes | ✅ Momentum transfer works |
| Inclined Plane | 1 block + 1 ramp (static) | 0 | ✅ Block slides on ramp |
| Spring-Mass System | 1 mass | 1 spring | ✅ Oscillates vertically |
| Projectile Motion | 1 ball | 0 | ✅ Parabolic trajectory |
| Domino Chain | 11 dominoes | 0 | ✅ Chain reaction cascade |
| Rope Bridge | 12 segments + 1 weight | 13 links | ✅ Bridge sags under load |
| Atwood Machine | 2 weights | 2 ropes | ✅ Differential acceleration |

### 10.2 Collaboration Testing

- ✅ Room creation and join via 6-character codes
- ✅ Real-time cursor tracking between users
- ✅ Experiment loading syncs across all users
- ✅ Play/Pause state syncs instantly
- ✅ Host-authoritative world state sync (1s interval)
- ✅ User disconnect/reconnect handled gracefully

